  "worked_solution": "Since we need to divide by $2$, we split the whole into $2$ equal parts horizontally.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14133144/assets/c7a402dc351163f8044557fd8fe73fe68b7af594284e92efc5115fde0017c7e2.png)\n\nFrom the picture on the right, we obtain that the shaded part represents $\\frac{4}{14}$ of the whole.\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{7}÷2=\\frac{4}{14}.\n$$",
